<body>
    <h1>Employee access current state request fulfillment</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <h3 id=3D"Employeeaccesscurrentstaterequestfulfillment-Currentstate=
"><span>Current state</span></h3>
<p>There are four use cases to be discussed in this feature.</p>
<ol>
 <li data-uuid=3D"fb07257e-b5f4-43b4-a6f6-77a6d3b4818b">
  <p>New employee onboarding&nbsp;</p></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"563c871c-7ba7-486a-92eb-b483e9a8e0de">
  <p>Modify access</p></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"f9f02c63-e139-4a07-9f55-a0c5c10d38f0">
  <p>Employee offboarding</p></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"09789b61-0d93-48b1-bb00-6f232d0f0202">
  <p>Employee access attestation</p></li>
</ol>
<p>Here is the process of the New employee onboarding use case. The steps f=
or Modify access use case and Employee offboarding use case are similar, ho=
wever, the request type (Add verse Modify verse Delete) and the correspondi=
ng actions would be different.&nbsp;</p>
<p>The current process of Employee access attestation per application is ap=
pended to the bottom of the table.</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"wrapped confluenceTable">
  <colgroup class=3D"">
   <col class=3D"">
   <col class=3D"">
   <col class=3D"">
   <col class=3D"">
   <col class=3D"">
   <col class=3D"">
   <col class=3D"">
  </colgroup>
  <tbody class=3D"">
   <tr class=3D"">
    <th colspan=3D"7" class=3D"confluenceTh">
     <p>Step-1. New employee's manager assesses the User need and follow th=
e Procedure to submit the requests</p></th>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">
     <p>User need</p></th>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">
     <p>Access to Legacy Compass functionalities?</p></th>
    <th colspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">
     <p>Access to Servicing on New Compass?</p></th>
    <th colspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">
     <p>Access to Trading?</p></th>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">
     <p>Access to New Compass core features?</p></th>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">
     <p>Procedure</p></th>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">
     <p>ServiceNow - Request access to Legacy Compass (R2)</p></th>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">
     <p>ServiceNow - Request access to GDI</p></th>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">
     <p>ServiceNow - Request access to SOMA</p></th>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">
     <p>ServiceNow - Request access to GDO</p></th>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">
     <p>ServiceNow - Request access to PCIS</p></th>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">
     <p>NCS - Request access to New Compass</p></th>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh"><br></th>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ol>
      <li data-uuid=3D"e5ed8a05-e88a-48b7-8c37-2a778eb56e45">
       <p>Go to <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://bnc.service-now.=
com/esc?id=3Dbnc_home" rel=3D"nofollow">Service Now</a> homepage</p></li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"e0d97386-ecf5-418d-aa77-35fddddaca71">
       <p>Submit a request to&nbsp;<a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https=
://bnc.service-now.com/esc?id=3Dsc_cat_item&amp;table=3Dsc_cat_item&amp;sys=
_id=3D7951f2b71b89de102c0a21fcbc4bcbed&amp;searchTerm=3D5213" rel=3D"nofoll=
ow">Add access to application 5213 - Compass (NBIN)</a>&nbsp;</p>
       <ol>
        <li>
         <p>Select a Role (R2 profile) from the drop-down</p></li>
       </ol></li>
     </ol></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ol>
      <li data-uuid=3D"ee6af3c5-8672-4286-af3d-f13ed89781d6">
       <p>Go to <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://bnc.service-now.=
com/esc?id=3Dbnc_home" rel=3D"nofollow">Service Now</a> homepage</p></li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"96133442-38bc-4621-b498-38158579ae60">
       <p>Submit a request to&nbsp;<a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https=
://bnc.service-now.com/esc?id=3Dsc_cat_item&amp;table=3Dsc_cat_item&amp;sys=
_id=3D99af227b1b49de102c0a21fcbc4bcb02&amp;searchTerm=3D0647" rel=3D"nofoll=
ow">Add access to application 0647 - GDI</a>&nbsp;</p>
       <ol>
        <li>
         <p>Select a Role from the drop-down</p></li>
       </ol></li>
     </ol></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Prerequisites: User has a SZ Id that has access to GDI</p>
     <ol>
      <li data-uuid=3D"56fa91cd-c0a3-455c-9e83-62afb0a64e9f">
       <p>Go to&nbsp;<a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://bnc.service=
-now.com/esc?id=3Dbnc_home" rel=3D"nofollow">Service Now</a> homepage</p></=
li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"95fe9220-900d-4854-a8eb-e871d44318c5">
       <p>Submit a request to&nbsp;<a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https=
://bnc.service-now.com/esc?id=3Dsc_cat_item&amp;table=3Dsc_cat_item&amp;sys=
_id=3D44a13e3b1b89de102c0a21fcbc4bcb15&amp;searchTerm=3D5861" rel=3D"nofoll=
ow">Add access to application 5861 - SOMA-Public APIs</a>&nbsp;</p>
       <ol>
        <li>
         <p>Select a Role from the drop-down</p></li>
        <li>
         <p>Provide a SZ Id with GDI access to ensure all allowed features =
in SOMA are accessible</p></li>
       </ol></li>
     </ol></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ol>
      <li data-uuid=3D"71827db4-0701-401d-a16c-ec8ce03c7e7e">
       <p>Go to <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://bnc.service-now.=
com/esc?id=3Dbnc_home" rel=3D"nofollow">Service Now</a> homepage</p></li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"eee0eef3-25e1-4bc6-8044-42e766ee7918">
       <p>Submit a request to&nbsp;<a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https=
://bnc.service-now.com/esc?id=3Dsc_cat_item&amp;table=3Dsc_cat_item&amp;sys=
_id=3Db9af227b1b49de102c0a21fcbc4bcbd8&amp;searchTerm=3D0657" rel=3D"nofoll=
ow">Add access to application 0657 - GDO</a>&nbsp;</p>
       <ol>
        <li>
         <p>Select a Role from the drop-down</p></li>
       </ol></li>
     </ol></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ol>
      <li data-uuid=3D"be2c66f3-934e-44b6-ab28-70732b9199a5">
       <p>Go to <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://bnc.service-now.=
com/esc?id=3Dbnc_home" rel=3D"nofollow">Service Now</a> homepage</p></li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"46245530-0472-4bf4-9761-56c1a1ae1d75">
       <p>Submit a request to&nbsp;<a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https=
://bnc.service-now.com/esc?id=3Dsc_cat_item&amp;table=3Dsc_cat_item&amp;sys=
_id=3D1000b6fb1b49de102c0a21fcbc4bcb0c&amp;searchTerm=3D1129" rel=3D"nofoll=
ow">Add access to application 1129 - PCIS</a>&nbsp;</p>
       <ol>
        <li>
         <p>Select a Role from the drop-down</p></li>
       </ol></li>
     </ol></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ol>
      <li data-uuid=3D"de0ad795-cb8a-45f3-b005-fbd1446ed13d">
       <p>Go to <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://jira.bnc.ca/serv=
icedesk/customer/portal/506/group/2247" rel=3D"nofollow">NBIN Product Suppo=
rt - NCE</a> homepage</p></li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"eb88e03d-7520-4c27-81ea-5a9d4d3ac9bc">
       <p>Submit a new access request to&nbsp;<a class=3D"external-link" hr=
ef=3D"https://jira.bnc.ca/servicedesk/customer/portal/506/create/8796" rel=
=3D"nofollow">NCE Access Requests</a>&nbsp;</p>
       <ol>
        <li>
         <p>Enter the R2 Id and SZ Id on the form, if applicable&nbsp;</p><=
/li>
       </ol></li>
     </ol></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <th colspan=3D"7" class=3D"confluenceTh">
     <p>Step-2. ID Custodians of the requested applications approve the req=
uests</p></th>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">
     <p>Procedure</p></th>
    <td colspan=3D"5" class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Service Now:</p>
     <ol>
      <li data-uuid=3D"0ef02ac2-f6bf-4c75-b16c-3b91da293309">
       <p>Approve request is sent to ID custodian groups of the requested a=
pplication automatically</p></li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"5155ffbb-2510-4a8f-a70c-a77986046e93">
       <p>ID custodians approve the add access request (NOTE: for R2, ID cu=
stodian is NBIN Product Support group)</p></li>
     </ol></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>NCS Service Desk:</p>
     <ol>
      <li data-uuid=3D"ae65359d-5bc8-4965-90ba-be0c10899873">
       <p>NBIN Product Support group screen the new access request for comp=
leteness</p>
       <ol>
        <li>
         <p>If there's any missing info, ask the requestor to fill in</p></=
li>
       </ol></li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"370f9caf-3df7-46f0-ae39-e3e0cfa6afa1">
       <p>NBIN Product Support group check for manager's approval</p>
       <ol>
        <li>
         <p>If it is not provided, ask the manager for approval</p></li>
       </ol></li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"8b0c7c09-e8a5-4772-a2ea-0a5c798c5c13">
       <p>NBIN Product Support group ask for NCE ID custodian (PS manager) =
to approve</p></li>
     </ol></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <th colspan=3D"7" class=3D"confluenceTh">
     <p>Step-3. ID Admins of the requested applications act on the requests=
</p></th>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">
     <p>Procedure</p></th>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>SAA team:</p>
     <ol>
      <li data-uuid=3D"51d5758a-9b51-4a02-bb17-69bc336b77c3">
       <p>Create a new R2 user account</p></li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"d10459ca-51d7-445d-acea-375c51bf605d">
       <p>Configure R2 access according to the access matrix, as per the re=
quested Role&nbsp;</p></li>
     </ol></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>SAA team:</p>
     <ol>
      <li data-uuid=3D"79fd156f-0e49-42d2-9580-5a3888a697c9">
       <p>Create a new SZ user account</p></li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"106671f2-bcfe-41c7-b039-7bb609dbef3b">
       <p>Configure GDI access according to the access matrix, as per the r=
equested Role&nbsp;</p></li>
     </ol></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>SAA team:</p>
     <ol>
      <li data-uuid=3D"fa6d987b-81bf-4769-b3a8-251887411a2d">
       <p>Modify the provided SZ Id&nbsp;</p></li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"12fddd08-fee6-41f7-9cbf-34a95188740f">
       <p>Config SOMA access according to the access matrix, as per the req=
uested Role&nbsp;</p></li>
     </ol></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>SAA team:</p>
     <ol>
      <li data-uuid=3D"3d9429cd-8991-4615-884b-74049c33b9ff">
       <p>Create a new GDO user account</p></li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"d8d829f8-62f2-4e4b-a08d-efe9d2b13c19">
       <p>Config access according to the access matrix, as per the requeste=
d Role&nbsp;</p></li>
     </ol></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>SAA team:</p>
     <ol>
      <li data-uuid=3D"7d6d82b7-6e21-4d78-8b5a-28e09db3685b">
       <p>Create a new PCIS user account</p></li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"5a883e5a-66d5-49f7-80c7-0d049a55e26a">
       <p>Config access according to the access matrix, as per the requeste=
d Role&nbsp;</p></li>
     </ol></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>NBIN Product Support team:</p>
     <ol>
      <li data-uuid=3D"de2b38b7-d33c-4035-9c50-9bc5ac841390">
       <p>Create a new NCE user account&nbsp;</p></li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"ba61516d-cd0d-4870-9e93-9aedc697797a">
       <p>Configure user role and settings according to the access matrix, =
by the user's business group&nbsp;</p></li>
     </ol></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">
     <p>Access matrix per application</p></th>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p><a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://cbncnbccs-my.sharepoint.=
com/:x:/g/personal/katrina_astrologo_nbc_ca/IQDrLKfYPFNWQ7uQIwlBvc5NAV2AQof=
fzx0tsl3NggLJrvU?e=3DR8f0yc" rel=3D"nofollow">5213 - NBIN Compass -20251211=
 - v4.6 1.xlsx</a></p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p><a href=3D"https://wiki.bnc.ca/spaces/SAU/pages/1490880626/IDAdmin+=
-+0657+-+GDO_VF" rel=3D"nofollow">IDAdmin - 0657 - GDO_VF - KB du SAU - Con=
fluence</a></p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p><br></p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p><a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://cbncnbccs-my.sharepoint.=
com/:x:/r/personal/jason_mepsted_nbc_ca/Documents/Microsoft%20Teams%20Chat%=
20Files/CompassX%20Employee%20Access.xlsx?d=3Dw776caf3d4c514cd1ae61ea2bbb2d=
027f&amp;csf=3D1&amp;web=3D1&amp;e=3DIN1bxf" rel=3D"nofollow">CompassX Empl=
oyee Access.xlsx</a></p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <th colspan=3D"7" class=3D"confluenceTh">
     <p>Step-4. ID Admins close the request tickets</p></th>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">
     <p>Procedure</p></th>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>SAA team:</p>
     <ol>
      <li data-uuid=3D"8150ce1d-c34f-447c-8903-9183b9346362">
       <p>Share the new R2 Id in the ticket</p></li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"7fa76080-0a34-4113-8b21-b07e1a7e7cdd">
       <p>Close the ticket</p></li>
     </ol>
     <p><span style=3D"color:#ae2e24;">TBC</span></p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>SAA team:</p>
     <ol>
      <li data-uuid=3D"e756f49f-d3e6-4ceb-9395-a9c8e66e356f">
       <p>Share the new SZ Id and password in the ticket</p></li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"8ba2d3da-bde5-404c-84a6-1e502315a3e4">
       <p>Close the ticket</p></li>
     </ol>
     <p><span style=3D"color:#ae2e24;">TBC</span></p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>SAA team:</p>
     <ol>
      <li data-uuid=3D"4600f333-984a-4f7a-aaad-e80ebcf5094c">
       <p>Close the ticket</p></li>
     </ol>
     <p><span style=3D"color:#ae2e24;">TBC</span></p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>SAA team:</p>
     <ol>
      <li data-uuid=3D"49aaa42a-8e12-4a35-bbad-669a4b6732d3">
       <p>Share the new GDO Id and password in the ticket</p></li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"bacc4b78-764d-48bd-ba7d-b33abb208568">
       <p>Close the ticket</p></li>
     </ol>
     <p>TBC</p></td>
