     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"c6863e77-63a2-418f-9723-613aff912f31">Weekly review =
of IIQ reports to cover departed employees, test ids</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"b882f6d6-ffa1-4097-a135-b321d2574b8f">Quarterly acce=
ss attestation manually, which takes approximately 2 days per quarter to fi=
nish, to deep review access provision&nbsp;</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"797e3e2b-c72e-496c-8751-958877c23a69">Yearly process=
 is similar to the quarterly one - submit report to Access Mgmt team. Proce=
ss takes approx. 2 months, back and forth with the teams</li>
     </ul></td>
